<title>UK: Regent Europe forms alliance with Tiger Securities.</title>
<headline>Regent Europe forms alliance with Tiger Securities.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regent European Securities, a subsidiary of Regent Pacific, and Tiger Securities Ltd said on Wednesday they had formed an alliance to strengthen their position in the Russian securities market.</p>
<p>&quot;The firms will cooperate in the areas of research, marketing and execution of Russian blue chip opportunities for Pacific region investors,&quot; they said in a statement.</p>
<p>Regent has an unspecified stake in Australian Pacific Gemini Pty Ltd, the parent of Tiger.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
